    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents are proud to bring Rose Cottage, Brackenstown Road, Swords, to the open market for sale. Set in one of North County Dublin`s most unique and enviable locations, this exceptional four-bedroom, four-bathroom property enjoys an elevated position overlooking the beautiful River Valley. Tucked away in a peaceful cul-de-sac, the property combines generous and versatile accommodation with extensive outdoor space, mature gardens and a wonderful sense of privacy, while remaining just minutes from Swords and Dublin Airport.\nCurrently operating as a B&B, Rose Cottage offers an exciting opportunity for a variety of uses, whether as a substantial family home, unique lifestyle property or potentially continuing in its existing use and many more with room for further development or extension subject to planning permission. \nOn entering, a bright and spacious hallway immediately creates an impressive sense of volume, rising dramatically to the roofline with the first-floor landing overlooking the entrance below. This striking feature provides a memorable introduction to the home. To the right of the entrance is a generous double bedroom with its own en-suite bathroom, walk-in wardrobe and direct access to the rear garden. The hallway also provides separate access to the rear of the property.\nThe heart of Rose Cottage is the impressive open-plan kitchen, living and dining area. The fully fitted kitchen offers excellent storage and preparation space, while the adjoining living and dining areas provide a superb setting for both everyday living and entertaining. A cosy seating area centred around a stove creates a welcoming focal point, while French doors open directly onto the rear garden, allowing an abundance of natural light and creating a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces.\nUpstairs, there are three further generously proportioned double bedrooms, each with its own private en-suite bathroom. The spacious rooms offer excellent flexibility for family accommodation, guest bedrooms, home offices or continued B&B use. The south-facing rear garden is a particular highlight of the property. A substantial stone patio extends directly from the kitchen/living/dining area, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining. Beyond the patio, the garden continues in a tiered arrangement, combining landscaped areas with generous usable space. The elevated position, mature planting and outlook across the River Valley create a wonderfully private and peaceful setting.\nA garden room provides valuable additional space and could suit a variety of uses, subject to any necessary planning requirements.\nRose Cottage is a truly distinctive property offering a rare combination of space, privacy, versatility and convenience. With four en-suite bedrooms, generous living accommodation, a south-facing garden, substantial outbuilding and an enviable River Valley outlook, this is a home that offers something genuinely different.\nLocated just minutes from Swords and Dublin Airport, yet enjoying a remarkably tranquil setting, Rose Cottage presents an exceptional opportunity to acquire a property of character and versatility in one of North County Dublin`s most sought-after areas.\n"
      },
